g7=A.bf("They touch what we throw away, so we can live in a cleaner world.",A.a(["Exposure to toxic chemicals & infections",d9,e0,"Low wages despite essential work","Risk of injuries from sharp objects"],g6),B.F,g7,"Sanitation workers are the unsung guardians of public health. They work tirelessly in the early hours, handling waste that most people wouldn't touch, ensuring our streets remain clean and our communities stay healthy.",B.hQ,"Sanitation Workers",4,"Keeping our cities clean & disease-free")
q=A.a(["Provide round-the-clock patient care","Administer medications & treatments","Offer emotional support to patients","Assist doctors in surgeries","Educate patients on health management"],g6)
