n=A.a(["Provide counseling & therapy","Help prevent suicides","Support addiction recovery","Reduce mental health stigma","Guide families through crises"],g6)
n=A.bf("They carry the weight of others' pain so they don't have to carry it alone.",A.a(["Emotional toll of hearing trauma","Risk of compassion fatigue","Dealing with crisis situations","Underfunded mental health systems","Long waitlists affecting patients"],g6),B.x,n,"Mental health workers support people struggling with psychological challenges. They provide counseling, crisis intervention, and ongoing support to help individuals navigate their mental health journey.",B.Ji,"Mental Health Workers",3,"Healing minds, restoring hope")
