m=A.bf("They give their time so others can have more of it.",A.a(["Physically demanding lifting & moving",e2,"Low wages for intensive work","Witnessing decline of patients",e3],g6),B.as,m,"Caregivers assist elderly, disabled, and chronically ill individuals with daily activities. They provide personal care, companionship, and support that allows people to maintain dignity and independence.",B.IG,"Caregivers",3,"Providing dignity in vulnerability")
l=A.a(["Save lives from fires & accidents","Rescue people from disasters","Prevent fires from spreading","Educate communities on fire safety","Respond to medical emergencies"],g6)
l=A.bf("When everyone runs out, they run in. True courage in action.",A.a(["Risk of burns & smoke inhalation","PTSD from traumatic rescues","Physical exhaustion from heavy gear","Away from family during emergencies","Exposure to carcinogenic materials"],g6),B.bf,l,"Firefighters put their lives on the line every single day. They rush into burning buildings, rescue trapped victims, and battle blazes that could consume entire neighborhoods\u2014all to keep us safe.",B.IW,"Firefighters",5,"Running into danger when others run away")
