j=A.a(["Locate missing persons","Rescue disaster survivors","Navigate treacherous terrain","Provide first aid in remote areas","Bring closure to families"],g6)
j=A.bf("They search until they find, rescue until they save.",A.a([e5,"Working in dangerous conditions","Emotional toll of unsuccessful searches","Limited resources & equipment","Exposure to harsh weather"],g6),B.X,j,"Search and rescue professionals locate and save people in disaster zones, wilderness areas, and collapsed buildings. They work in the most dangerous conditions to bring people home.",B.oj,"Search & Rescue Teams",5,"Finding hope in impossible places")
